meta {
  name: 11 Get Sale (IDOR check)
  type: http
  seq: 12
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sales/{{saleUuid}}
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  Episode 15 — the IDOR demo.

  The URL uses a UUID, not a sequential id, so it can't be enumerated by
  counting. But that's a speed bump, not the fix.

  On camera:
    1. as the cashier who made the sale → 200
    2. "02 Login (cashier)" as a DIFFERENT cashier, re-run → 404
       (404, not 403 — a 403 would confirm the sale exists)
    3. as the manager → 200
}
